   "Implement a binary search tree (insert, search, delete); explain BST invariant",
   "Implement a hash table with separate chaining; explain load factor and collision resolution",
   "Implement BFS and DFS on a graph; identify when to use each",
   "Solve a dynamic programming problem from scratch (Knapsack, LCS, or edit distance)",
   "Solve 50 LeetCode medium problems with correct solutions and time/space analysis",
