   targets:{MS2:2,MS3:3,LDAC:5,MS4:5,commission:6,O1:7},
   why:"Military briefings follow specific formats. The ability to build and deliver a slide deck to a command audience is a distinct, trainable skill from general public speaking.",
   howTo:"Study the four types of military briefings (information, decision, staff, mission). Build your slides using BLUF structure: bottom line first. Practice out loud — delivery is not learned by reading. Time yourself every rehearsal.",
