   levels:["Implement BFS and DFS on a graph represented as an adjacency list; traverse a sample graph with both","Implement Dijkstra's shortest-path algorithm; find shortest path between two nodes in a weighted graph","Implement topological sort; explain what a cycle in the dependency graph means","Solve an island-counting or connected-components problem using DFS or union-find","Solve a shortest-path problem where Dijkstra doesn't apply (negative edges or shortest path in an unweighted graph) by choosing the correct algorithm and justifying it"],
