   advance:["Reach L1: all 5 Recovery Rares.","Reach L2: 30-day consistent window.","Reach L3: chronotype aligned; effect documented.","Reach L4: 3 environment dimensions optimized.","Reach L5: planned nap executed; effect measured.","Reach L6: sleep debt calculated + recovery planned.","Reach L7: field exercise sleep discipline.","Reach L8: 60-day all-domain logged.","Reach L9: HRV-sleep correlation.","Reach L10: 48h full recovery after 72h restriction.","Reach L11: 6-month documented."],
