   "Implement a complete peri-workout nutrition protocol (pre, intra if needed, post) for one training cycle",
   "Adjust nutrition successfully to achieve a measured body composition goal (gain or cut) over 8 weeks",
   "Sustain nutrition discipline through a field exercise with limited food access; document what worked and what failed",
