   why:"Like other thermal protocols, contrast therapy's benefits compound with consistent repeated use rather than one-off sessions.",
   howTo:"Complete contrast therapy sessions on a regular schedule (e.g., after every hard training session) and log a consecutive streak.",
   levels:["Complete 2 contrast sessions in one week","Complete contrast sessions on a regular schedule for 2 consecutive weeks","Complete contrast sessions on a regular schedule for 4 consecutive weeks","Sustain the regular schedule for 8 consecutive weeks"],
