   setKey:"roots_r_resilience", synthesizedFrom:"roots_u_emotional_recovery", fadeDays:30,
   why:"How quickly you recover from an emotional hit — anger, disappointment, fear, frustration — determines whether one event contaminates the next. Fast, clean recovery is a professional skill for anyone who leads or competes.",
