   advance:["Reach L1: measure your actual time-to-recovery from frustration or anger.","Reach L2: measure and track time-to-recovery from disappointment.","Reach L3: compartmentalization practiced — one emotional event doesn't trigger another.","Reach L4: emotional reset protocol established.","Reach L5: reset protocol applied in a live, high-stakes situation.","Reach L6: recovery from anger under 10 minutes in most cases.","Reach L7: emotional slate cleared between every context switch.","Reach L8: automatic and fast — no event dominates a context it doesn't belong in."],
