   unlockHint:"This card feeds the Physical Mentorship Rare.",
   why:"Mentorship that happens in one burst and then fades isn't mentorship, it's a pep talk. Managing a real cycle — regular check-ins, a visible plan, and a defined end point or renewal — is what makes the relationship durable enough to actually change a soldier's trajectory.",
