   levels:["L1: Explain the full responsibilities of a range OIC/NCOIC before an event","L2: Shadow an OIC/NCOIC through a full live-fire qualification range","L3: Serve as OIC/NCOIC for a low-risk live-fire event under mentor observation","L4: Serve as OIC/NCOIC of record for a live-fire qualification range with zero safety violations","L5: Serve as OIC/NCOIC of record for 2+ separate live-fire ranges with zero safety violations on each"],
   roadmap:["Know OIC/NCOIC duties","Shadow a full range day","OIC/NCOIC, low-risk, mentored","OIC/NCOIC of record, zero violations","2+ ranges, zero violations each"],
