   unlockHint:"This card feeds the CASEVAC Coordination Rare.",
   why:"A correct 9-line on paper is useless if it can't be transmitted clearly over radio under time pressure — voice procedure, brevity, and format discipline are what make the call actionable on the receiving end.",
   howTo:"Transmit a completed 9-line over a radio (or radio simulation) to a training partner acting as the receiving station, using correct prowords and format; have the partner read back and check for errors.",
