   unlockHint:"This card feeds the Tactical Radio Networks Rare.",
   why:"Before net discipline or troubleshooting mean anything, you have to be able to turn a radio on, set it correctly, and key the handset without fumbling — the physical fundamentals that everything else in the Rare builds on.",
   howTo:"Practice powering up, setting frequency/channel, and PTT technique on an actual tactical radio (or trainer) until it requires no thought. Time yourself getting from cold start to correct frequency.",
   levels:["L1: Power on a tactical radio and identify all controls by name","L2: Set a given frequency or channel correctly without assistance","L3: Key the handset and transmit a clear, understandable test call","L4: Configure a radio from a cold start (frequency, volume, squelch) in under 60 seconds","L5: Set up and test 2 different radio models without a manual"],
