   roadmap:["retrans purpose known","dead zone ID on map","retrans station planned","manual relay planned","integrated into full plan"],
   advance:["Reach L1: learn when retransmission or relay is needed.","Reach L2: identify a likely dead zone on a map for a route.","Reach L3: plan a retrans station position to cover it.","Reach L4: plan a manual relay procedure as backup.","Reach L5: fold retrans/relay planning into a full multi-leg signal plan."],
