   unlockHint:"This card feeds the Sustainment Planning Rare.",
   why:"A multi-day exercise runs out of supplies unless someone plans where and when resupply happens. Picking a workable resupply point and timeline is a concrete, gradeable planning skill distinct from just knowing the numbers.",
   howTo:"For a real or realistic multi-day field exercise, select a resupply point location and timing that accounts for the tactical situation and travel time. Practice briefing the resupply plan clearly enough that someone else could execute it.",
   levels:["Explain the purpose and general timing considerations of a resupply point","Select a plausible resupply point location for a given exercise scenario","Build a resupply timeline that accounts for travel time and the tactical situation","Plan a resupply point that avoids compromising the element's position or security","Brief a complete resupply plan (location, timing, security) clearly enough to execute"],
   roadmap:["explain resupply point purpose","select plausible location","build timeline w/ travel+tactical","plan w/o compromising security","brief complete resupply plan"],
