   why:"Self-assessment plateaus without outside correction — someone more advanced can see errors you can't see in yourself. Getting structured feedback and actually applying it within a short window is what separates fast learners from people who repeat the same mistake for years.",
   howTo:"Get feedback on a specific skill from someone more advanced than you (coach, mentor, peer with more reps). Apply the specific correction within the same week and confirm whether it changed your performance.",
